{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>聯乘Shake Shack!食糯米糍有新配搭</p><p>Shake Shack聯乘民豐推開心果奶昔！</p><p>Shake Shack首度聯乘香港老字號品牌民豐粉麵行，以升級配方打造全新的開心果手工麻糬奶昔！以 Shake Shack 招牌自家製雲呢拿雪糕為基底，配搭香濃意大利開心果醬及每日新鮮製作的軟糯鮮奶麻糬，口感煙韌彈牙，奶昔頂層配上鮮忌廉，並灑滿民豐粉麵行自家烘烤開心果碎，香滑細膩，開心果味濃厚有層次。</p><p>Shake Shack全新法式香草系列</p><p>Shake Shack同步推出全新法式香草系列，包括法式香草牛肉堡、法式香草雞肉堡、法式香草風味雞粒及法式香草風味薯條。特別選用口感幼滑、層次豐富的法式伯納西醬（Béarnaise Sauce）為靈魂，配搭各式食材，層次豐富，令人一試難忘。</p><p>Shake Shack 備註：開心果手工麻糬奶昔將於 9 月 15 日至 11 月 30 日期間，香港全線 Shake Shack 分店限時供應。 官方IG：@shakeshackhongkong</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904164357526870_13255743606aa29bebe6841.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904164566051422_10467166606aa29bee07fb6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904164763240186_11096741836aa29bf010c8f.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904164953462707_13159550266aa29bf20e5a4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904165157179250_7220045266aa29bf487984.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904165380874462_10442909806aa29bf635f72.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178904165562384806_2296271936aa29bf8388e6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T12:20:06.259075+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":510,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}